","en":"Force Breach"}}],"battleCards":[],"debateCards":[],"warSouls":[],"battleSouls":[{"id":"1020305","name":{"zh":"作战统帅","en":"Battle Commander"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"每回合开始时，会使范围3米内的友军各自有50%的概率随机从获得【嗜血】、【振奋】、【奋战】中获得一个状态。","en":"At turn start, each ally within 3m has a 50% chance to gain one of 【Bloodlust】, 【Morale Up】, or 【Battle Fervor】."}}],"debateSouls":[],"soulPoints":{"war":6000,"battle":4900,"debate":3600},"equipment":[{"id":"WP12012","name":{"zh":"钢刀","en":"Steel Saber"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"钢制大刀，更加锋利。","en":"A steel great blade with a keener edge."},"atkVal":"6","price":"2400","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1004805","name":{"zh":"单片护心甲","en":"Single-Plate Heart Guard"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"在单片甲的基础上额外添加了一件铁护心，通常由校尉或伍长穿戴。","en":"Single-plate armor with an added iron heart guard, typically worn by captains or squad leaders."},"defenceVal":"9","price":"3800","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1019305","name":{"zh":"白缨毛胄","en":"White Tassel Fur Helm"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"在普通毛胄的基础上增加了白缨作为装饰，多为北方将领佩戴。","en":"A fur helmet enhanced with a white plume, typically worn by northern generals."},"defenceVal":"6","price":"5000","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP29001","name":{"zh":"战马","en":"Warhorse"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"战场上必不可少的身影。","en":"An indispensable presence on the battlefield."},"price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"坐骑","en":"Mount"}}],"family":{"children":{"label":{"zh":"子女","en":"Children"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10395","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI110415","name":{"zh":"丘力居氏","en":"The Qiuliju clan"},"years":["0","207"],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，乌桓为东胡别支。丘力居为辽西乌桓大人，统领五千余落。辽西乌桓大人丘力居，自称王。中平四年与张纯、张举起兵反汉，寇略青、徐、幽、冀四州，后归顺幽州牧刘虞。初平年间去世后，其从子蹋顿代立，总摄三郡乌桓。建安十二年，曹操北征乌桓，在白狼山之战斩杀蹋顿，乌桓自此衰落。","en":"Originating from the Donghu, the Wuhuan were an offshoot branch of the Donghu. Qiu Lijiu was a chieftain of the Liaoxi Wuhuan, commanding over 5,000 settlements. Chieftain Qiu Lijiu of the Liaoxi Wuhuan proclaimed himself King. In the 4th year of Zhongping, he took up arms alongside Zhang Chun and Zhang Ju against the Han, raiding Qing, Xu, You, and Ji Provinces, before eventually submitting to Liu Yu, Governor of You Province. Following his death in the Chuping era, his nephew Tadun succeeded him, overseeing the Wuhuan across three commanderies. In the 12th year of Jian'an, Cao Cao campaigned North against the Wuhuan and slew Tadun at the Battle of White Wolf Mountain, after which the Wuhuan fell into decline."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"5","politics":"4"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,70,60,52,69,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"11950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1004805","helmet":"WP1019305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10334","city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":1,"stats":[78,70,60,52,69,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"11950","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1004805","helmet":"WP1019305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[78,70,60,52,69,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"9800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1004805","helmet":"WP1019305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸侯讨董","en":"Coalition Against Dong Zhuo"},"year":"190"