"3","role":0,"stats":[78,70,60,52,69,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1004805","helmet":"WP1019305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,70,60,52,69,65],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1004805","helmet":"WP1019305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[78,70,60,52,69,65],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"0","reputation":"9800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1004805","helmet":"WP1019305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10334","city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":1,"stats":[78,70,60,52,69,65],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"9800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP12012","armor":"WP1004805","helmet":"WP1019305","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1010108","name":{"zh":"丘力居自立","en":"Qiu Liju Declares Independence"},"year":"188","month":"12","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1010208","name":{"zh":"蹋顿自立","en":"Tadun Declares Independence"},"year":"193","month":"5","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"少数民族乌丸首领，在辽西自立为王。东汉末年，丘力居趁乱与中山太守张纯联手起兵，发起叛乱。但不久后张纯就被前来平叛公孙瓒所杀，丘力居亦被镇压军围困。次年刘虞上任幽州牧，便对丘力居进行游说劝降，顺利使丘力归降朝廷。丘力居去世后，由从子蹋顿继位。","tc":"少數民族烏丸首領，在遼西自立為王。東漢末年，丘力居趁亂與中山太守張純聯手起兵，發起叛亂。但不久后張純就被前來平叛公孫瓚所殺，丘力居亦被鎮壓軍圍困。次年劉虞上任幽州牧，便對丘力居進行游說勸降，順利使丘力歸降朝廷。丘力居去世后，由從子蹋頓繼位。","en":"Chieftain of the Wuwan who proclaimed himself king in Liaoxi. In the late Eastern Han, Qiuliju allied with Governor of Zhongshan Zhang Chun to launch a rebellion. However, Zhang Chun was soon killed by Gongsun Zan, who had been dispatched to suppress the uprising, and Qiuliju was also besieged by the suppression forces. The following year, Liu Yu assumed the post of Governor of You Province and persuaded Qiuliju to surrender to the imperial court. After Qiuliju's death, the succession passed to his nephew Tadun.","jp":"少数民族烏丸の首領。遼西にて自立して王を称した。後漢末、丘力居は乱に乗じて中山太守の張純と結託して挙兵し、反乱を起こした。しかし程なくして張純は反乱鎮圧に現れた公孫瓚に討たれ、丘力居も鎮圧軍に包囲された。翌年、劉虞が幽州牧に着任すると、丘力居を説得して降伏を促し、首尾よく朝廷に帰順させた。丘力居の死後は、従子の蹋頓が跡を継いだ。","kr":"이민족 오환의 수령으로, 요서에서 스스로 왕을 칭했다. 후한 말, 구력거는 혼란을 틈타 중산태수 장순과 손잡고 거병하여 반란을 일으켰다. 그러나 얼마 지나지 않아 장순은 난을 진압하러 온 공손찬에게 토벌당했고, 구력거 역시 진압군에게 포위되었다. 이듬해 유우가 유주목으로 부임하여 구력거에게 귀순을 권유하자 마침내 조정에 투항하였다. 구력거 사후에는 조카 답돈이 그 뒤를 이었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10334","remark":"","surname":"丘","surnameTc":"丘","surnameEn":"Qiu","surnameJp":"丘","surnameKr":"구","surnameOther":"","name":"力居","nameTc":"力居","nameEn":"Liju","nameJp":"力居","nameKr":"력거","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"丘力居","power":"WJ10334","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1069","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"70","wise":"60","politics":"52","charm":"69","will":"65","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"33/33/33/73/33/23/50/33","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1008202;1006302","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1020305","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"4900","debateSoulPoint":"3600","strategy":"1000501","strategy2":"1005001","professions":"3/0/4/2/0/0/2/0/0/0/3/3/2/0/2/0/0/0/0/1/0